            "st_name\": \"Clapton\"}}, {{\"first_name\": \"Bob\", \"last_name\": \"Se" +
            "ger\"}}]}}"),
        ("inline-table/array-02",
            "# \"No newlines are allowed between the curly braces unless t" +
